  "body": "## Why\n\nA production log exposed two user-visible failures:\n\n1. some S26 conversations started on Oct 4 sent one offer and then appeared silent;\n2. bot 3 / S25 received a formal seller price (e.g. 1264 PLN) on Vinted but the conversation was no longer inspected, so it never reached \"Oferty do kupienia\".\n\nThe audit also found a third stall: an adaptive NEXT_STEP rejected by Vinted as below its live minimum was retried forever at the same invalid price.\n\n## Root causes\n\n- PENDING no-response timing multiplied the configured wait by 2, so a configured 24h step silently became 48h.\n- scheduler only considered NEGOTIATING rows; a recently REJECTED/EXPIRED/technical-unavailable conversation could receive a later formal seller counteroffer and never be opened again.\n- later adaptive steps had no live-minimum recovery even though first offers already supported adaptive Vinted-minimum handling.\n\n## Fix\n\n### Normal active negotiations\n- non-final PENDING advances after the configured rejection wait, not 2x it;\n- final-step 48h expiry is unchanged;\n- formal seller counteroffers <= adaptive global cap still become ACTION_REQUIRED immediately.\n\n### Bounded terminal conversation watch\n- watches only recent technical terminal statuses: REJECTED, EXPIRED, UNAVAILABLE, CONTACT_UNAVAILABLE;\n- 7-day window, recheck throttle 5 minutes, max 4 candidates per product/run;\n- newest unseen terminal conversations are prioritized;\n- active NEGOTIATING conversations are always processed first;\n- recovery inspection is read-only and never sends an offer directly;\n- a fresh affordable formal seller counteroffer/acceptance can become ACTION_REQUIRED immediately;\n- non-final technical closures may reopen only when an immutable pinned strategy snapshot exists;\n- legacy rows without a pinned strategy may surface a fresh seller price for manual purchase, but are never auto-reopened to send prices using today's strategy.\n\n### Adaptive Vinted live minimum\n- if a later adaptive step is rejected as too low and Vinted exposes the exact minimum, retry preparation at that live minimum;\n- never exceed maxAutomaticOffer;\n- quota/action guard is acquired only after the adjusted price prepares successfully;\n- static mode remains fail-closed.\n\n## Safety unchanged\n- 25/day hard quota unchanged;\n- real-action idempotency guard unchanged;\n- no recovery path clicks Buy;\n- no historical PURCHASED / user-skipped rows are watched;\n- strategy versioning remains authoritative for started conversations.\n\n## Regression coverage\n- configured pending cadence including 24h-not-48h case;\n- exact 1264 PLN parsing and 1264 <= 1450 ACTION_REQUIRED;\n- terminal 1264 recovery;\n- non-final pinned recovery vs legacy no-snapshot fail-closed;\n- scheduler sees due recovery work even with zero NEGOTIATING rows;\n- recovery preserves old step timers;\n- live Vinted minimum 1080 adaptation and cap refusal;\n- watched-status allowlist.\n",
